Abstract = {To begin with the image codes linked to the mixed emotional words are
   explained. Secondary the theory for a subjective observation model to
   the application of emotion processing system is briefly explained. Then,
   some attractive results obtained by the simulated emotion processing
   system are shown, namely what kind of emotions are evoked, and how the
   emotional transition is done by subjective observations, when a image
   codes database is used for the input signal. Furthermore, we could
   obtain several emotional clustering diagrams processed by pair vectors
   such as {[}optimism, curiosity], which is very attractive result from a
   psychological viewpoint.},
