   Health, Guilin, PEOPLES R CHINA, MAY 29-31, 2009},
Organization = {Hunan Univ; Univ Hong Kong; Tsinghua Univ},
Abstract = {The Tibetan plateau is characterized by high altitudes, low oxygen
   concentration, the atmosphere is extremely transparent, wide diurnal
   range temperature, special culture and life style, so solar radiation,
   thermal environment and IAQ are claimed attention. In this study, inside
   temperature, humidity, CO and CO2 concentration field measurements were
   made for a multifamily apartment building located in Tibet's capital and
   in traditional houses located in suburban agricultural community in
   order to evaluate their levels in the outdoor working environment and
   the environment inside the houses. In the meantime, questionnaire survey
   about environmental consideration was carried out, too. The data was
   collected in order to provide background information for considering
   improvements.},
