Abstract = {Strolling along Riau Street and shopping in Factory Outlet are major
   attraction to the visitor as well as to the small-scale entrepreuner for
   the urban spectacle and business opportunity being suggested. This paper
   will discuss the informal activities that constitute urban spectacle on
   the pedestrian ways in front of the Factory Outlet, and the
