   in the feature vectors are introduced the LPC coefficients, with
   previous results obtained with prosodic features (F0-fundamental
   frequency, F1-F4-formants), respectively MFCC (Mel frequency) cepstral
   coefficients. From the extended sets of parameters that we introduced
