Abstract = {Studies on environmental competitiveness of urban tourism contribute to
   optimize tourism environment and promote the sustainable development of
   Chinese cities. In this paper, the authors select 15 competitiveness
   indicators and establish a multi-level indicator system for tourism
   environment assessment. Taking 14 prefecture-level cities in Liaoning
   province as an example, SPSS 15.0 is used to conduct a quantitative
   evaluation to each city's tourism environment competitiveness. At the
   end of the paper, the authors propose several suggestions to improve the
   tourism environment competitiveness of cities in Liaoning Province.},
