   architectural spaces, as there are many disagreements in the perception
   of individuals from them. The present research benefits from Osgood's
   semantic differential technique (1957), and the definition of the
   bipolar characteristics is based on Ittelson's model (1978). In order to
   achieve the desired results, two intercity bus terminals of Isfahan are
   chosen. The results reveal that there is a significant difference
   between the ideas of architects and non-architects in connection to the
   different dimensions of the area, including ``cognitive{''};
