Note = {International Symposium on Sustainable-Development-of-City-Group,
   Changsha, PEOPLES R CHINA, NOV 16, 2009},
Organization = {Sustainable Dev City Grp; Cent S Univ, Hunan Inst Syst Engn \&
   Management},
Abstract = {The thesis explores whether marketing theory is applicable to urban
   agglomeration. It focuses on comparing between single city marketing and
   urban agglomeration marketing and how to settle the arisen issues. Based
   on game theory elements classification several aspects are analyzed. It
   found that there are differences between them. There are both market
   failure and government failure emerged in a single city's urban
   marketing when put cities into one urban agglomeration. Further analysis
   showed these problems can be settled by urban agglomeration marketing
   which organization design accord with common agency theory. It concludes
   that marketing theory is necessary and viable applied to urban
   agglomeration. As an active implement, urban agglomeration marketing is
   beneficial to regional development.},
