Abstract = {A system of devices has been developed for detailed monitoring of
   environmental parameters in indoor and outdoor environments. Designed
   for classrooms, the system monitors a variety of parameters that affect
   the well-being of users. Using digital sensors and an ESP32
   microcontroller, it ensures real-time data transmission and storage.
