Abstract = {Behavior adaptation and personalization are critical in human-robot
   interaction. Thus, automatically collected feedback from people proves
   to be a feasible solution. Human emotions represent insightful feedback
   that can be collected from people. This paper presents a comparative
   study of some well-known emotion recognition neural networks currently
